title: $:/plugins/mblackman/tiddlypwa/config-crypto
tags: $:/tags/ControlPanel/TiddlyPWA
caption: Password Protection

\define tv-wikilinks() no

<h3>🔐 Biometric Unlock (Touch ID / Face ID)</h3>

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWABiometricAvailable" text="yes">

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWABiometricConfigured" text="yes">
<p style="color: #0f5132; background: #d1e7dd; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #badbcc;">
	<strong>✅ Biometric Unlock is active on this device.</strong> You can unlock this wiki instantly with Touch ID, Face ID, or Windows Hello.
</p>
<p>
	<$button message="tiddlypwa-disable-biometrics">Disable Biometric Unlock</$button>
</p>
</$reveal>

<$reveal type="nomatch" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWABiometricConfigured" text="yes">
<p>Unlock your wiki instantly without typing your master passphrase every time. Your master key is hardware-encrypted on this device using WebAuthn platform biometrics.</p>
<p>
	<$button message="tiddlypwa-enable-biometrics" class="tc-btn-big tc-btn-primary">Enable Touch ID / Face ID Unlock</$button>
</p>
</$reveal>

</$reveal>

<$reveal type="nomatch" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWABiometricAvailable" text="yes">
<p style="color: #666; font-style: italic;">
	Biometric platform authentication (WebAuthn) is not supported in this browser environment or requires HTTPS/localhost.
</p>
</$reveal>

<hr style="margin: 1.5em 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">

<h3>Legacy Browser Key Storage</h3>

The password (or technically, the encryption key derived from it) is currently
<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWARemembered" text="yes">
''remembered'' on this device. <$button message="tiddlypwa-forget">Forget it</$button>?
</$reveal>
<$reveal type="nomatch" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWARemembered" text="yes">
''not remembered'' on this device. <$button message="tiddlypwa-remember">Remember it</$button>?
</$reveal>

<p style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #666;">
(Warning: remembering the password stores unencrypted keys in browser storage, leaving the contents of this wiki unprotected against anyone with physical access to this browser profile or origin <code>{{$:/status/TiddlyPWAOrigin}}</code>. Biometric Unlock is recommended instead.)
</p>

<hr style="margin: 1.5em 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">

<h3>Wiki Salt</h3>

The salt value for this wiki is: <code>{{$:/status/TiddlyPWASalt}}</code><br>
<span style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #666;">(Pre-configured automatically during QR device pairing, or used for manual cross-wiki synchronization setup).</span>
